{"id": "397", "title": "魔法学徒", "author": "蓝晶", "category": "玄幻魔法", "count": 205, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/0/397.htm", "intro": "传说中，魔族与神族原本共同居住在这个世界上，他们力量相同而个性相反，两者原本无所争执。但是，为了争夺对人类的控制权，神魔之间终于爆发了“光辉战役”。战役之后，强大力量破开空间，形成诸多不同世界，经过几千年的时光，人类重建文明，并成为这个世界的主人。然而神魔两族仍然不断试图染指与掌控这个人的世界——\r\n　　杂货店出身的少年恩莱科，便出现在这风云多变的时代，他的资质根本不适于修炼魔法，但是却当上了好色奸诈的魔法师维克多的弟子，和另外三位患难朋友——贝尔蒂娜、凯特以及杰瑞，展开了魔法试炼生的冒险生涯，迈向后世圣典所称的“先知”的开天辟地之途……", "base": "files/article/html/0/397", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第01～02集", "file": "63304.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第03～04集", "file": "63305.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第05～06集", "file": "63306.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第07～08集", "file": "63307.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第09～10集", "file": "63308.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11～12集", "file": "63309.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13～14集", "file": "63310.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15～16集", "file": "63311.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17～18集", "file": "63312.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19～20集", "file": "63313.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21～22集", "file": "63314.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23～24集", "file": "63315.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25～26集", "file": "63316.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第27～28集", "file": "63317.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第29～30集", "file": "63318.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第31～32集", "file": "63319.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第33～34集", "file": "63320.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第35～36集", "file": "63321.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第37集（全文完）", "file": "63322.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一章 学徒", "file": "63323.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章 魔女", "file": "63324.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章 契约", "file": "63325.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章 应征", "file": "63326.html", "available": 